requirement_description:
The objective of this TO is to procure a broad range of professional support services for requiring organizations across NAVWAR, to include the following:

a)	Program Management Support;
b)	Acquisition Management Support;
c)	Administrative Support;
d)	Contract Management Support;
e)	Installation Management Support;
f)	Information Systems Analysis Support;
g)	Cybersecurity Engineering Support;
h)	Systems Engineering Support; and
i)	Foreign Military Sales Program Support.
